--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOW TO VERIFY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Python components:

    pip install pip-licenses
    pip-licenses --format=markdown --with-urls --with-license-file

Node.js components:

    npx license-checker --summary
    npx license-checker --production --json > licenses.json

Go components:

    go install github.com/google/go-licenses@latest
    go-licenses report ./...

Run the applicable command before every release and reconcile the output with
the entries below. Any dependency appearing in the PROHIBITED list above must
be removed or replaced before publishing.

